[43.724, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[1;1H\u001b[2K also returned a vision-model trainer, a paper publisher and a deployment-container helper, which I left out  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2;1H\u001b[2K because they're off-topic.                                                                                   \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[3;1H\u001b[2K                                                                                                              \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[4;1H\u001b[2K To install one, just tell me which.                                                                          \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[5;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[6;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m                                                                                                              \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[7;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m \u001b[39mInstall the huggingface-llm-trainer skill.                                                                   \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[8;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m                                                                                                              \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[9;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[10;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m                                                                                                              \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[11;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m \u001b[39m\u001b[1mard_install\u001b[22m\u001b[39m \u001b[39m\u001b[2midentifier=\"urn:air:github.com:huggingface:skills:huggingface-llm-trainer\"\u001b[22;39m                       \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[12;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m                                                                                                              \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[13;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[14;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[38;5;4m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2