[47.811, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[1;1H\u001b[2K \u001b[38;5;5m2. \u001b[39m\u001b[1mtrain-sentence-transformers\u001b[22m (\u001b[38;5;5murn:air:github.com:huggingface:skills:train-sentence-transformers\u001b[39m)           \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2;1H\u001b[2K    Trains or fine-tunes sentence-transformers models, such as embedding models used for search. It's         \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[3;1H\u001b[2K    narrower: it handles embedding models, not text generation.                                               \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[4;1H\u001b[2K    \u001b[38;5;4m\u001b[4mhttps://github.com/huggingface/skills/tree/main/skills/train-sentence-transformers\u001b[24m\u001b[39m                        \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[6;1H\u001b[2K \u001b[38;5;5m3. \u001b[39m\u001b[1mhuggingface-lora-space-builder\u001b[22m (\u001b[38;5;5murn:air:github.com:huggingface:skills:huggingface-lora-space-builder\u001b[39m)     \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[7;1H\u001b[2K    Builds and publishes a Gradio demo on Hugging Face Spaces for a LoRA you've already made. It doesn't do   \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[8;1H\u001b[2K    training; it's for showing off the result.                                                                \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[9;1H\u001b[2K    \u001b[38;5;4m\u001b[4mhttps://github.com/huggingface/skills/tree/main/skills/huggingface-lora-space-builder\u001b[24m\u001b[39m                     \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[11;1H\u001b[2K All 3 come from the official \u001b[38;5;5mhuggingface/skills\u001b[39m repo. They're marked trusted but aren't signed. The search   \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[12;1H\u001b[2K also returned a vision-model trainer, a paper publisher and a deployment-container helper, which I left out  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[13;1H\u001b[2K because they're off-topic.                                                                                   \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[14;1H\u001b[2K                                                                                                              \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[15;1H\u001b[2K To install one, just tell me which.                                                                          \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[16;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[17;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m                                                                                                              \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[18;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m \u001b[39mInstall the huggingface-llm-trainer skill.                                                                   \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[19;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m                                                                                                              \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[20;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[21;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m                                                                                                              \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[22;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m \u001b[39m\u001b[1mard_install\u001b[22m\u001b[39m \u001b[39m\u001b[2midentifier=\"urn:air:github.com:huggingface:skills:huggingface-llm-trainer\"\u001b[22;39m                       \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[23;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m \u001b[39m\u001b[2minstalled: skill \"huggingface-llm-trainer\" at /tmp/demo-home/.pi/agent/skills/huggingface-llm-trainer        \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[24;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m \u001b[2m(sha256 fb5c5e25103e\u2026). Run /reload to load it. WARNING: only SKILL.md was installed; it references 18       \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[25;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m \u001b[2mbundled file(s) that are missing (references/training_methods.md, references/unsloth.md,                     \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[26;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m \u001b[2mscripts/unsloth_sft_example.py, scripts/train_sft_example.py, scripts/train_dpo_example.py, \u2026). Source:      \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[27;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m \u001b[2mhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/huggingface/skills/main/skills/huggingface-llm-trainer/SKILL.md\u001b[22;39m            \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[34;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[39m\u001b[2m\u219112k \u2193882 2.5%/200k (auto)\u001b[22;39m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m                                                                         claude-opus\u001b[22;39m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[31;1H\u001b[?25l\u001b[?2026l"]
